&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400 !important; font-size: 1.3em !important; color: #000;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/188870/rss" title="www.csstypestudio.com" style=" color: #D94306;"&gt;CSS Type Studio: A Web Tool for Fiddling with Advanced Typography with CSS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; — An easy-to-use tool for visually trying out all sorts of typography features, including text wrapping, kerning, OpenType features, and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CSS Type Studio &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;

